---
---

<section
  id="top"
  class="grain relative overflow-hidden bg-bark-900 px-6 pt-36 pb-24 text-cream-50"
>
  <!-- glow blobs -->
  <div class="glow h-[420px] w-[420px] bg-ember-500/30" style="top:-120px; right:-80px;"></div>
  <div class="glow h-[360px] w-[360px] bg-gold-500/20" style="bottom:-140px; left:-100px;"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center">
    <p
      class="reveal mb-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-gold-300 uppercase"
      style="animation-delay: 0.05s;"
    >
      <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ember-400"></span>
      IA con seguridad, hecha para tu negocio
    </p>

    <h1
      class="reveal font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl"
      style="animation-delay: 0.15s;"
    >
      Tu equipo no da abasto.<br class="hidden sm:block" />
      <span class="text-molten">La IA a medida</span> cambia eso.
    </h1>

    <p
      class="reveal mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream-200/80"
      style="animation-delay: 0.3s;"
    >
      Eliminamos el trabajo repetitivo, reducimos errores y ayudamos a tu negocio a escalar sin
      contratar más personas. Soluciones de IA y seguridad
      <span class="font-semibold text-cream-50">a medida de tu operación</span>, no plantillas genéricas.
    </p>

    <div
      class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row"
      style="animation-delay: 0.45s;"
    >
      <a
        href="#contacto"
        class="group rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ember-500 to-ember-600 px-8 py-4 font-bold text-white shadow-xl shadow-ember-500/30 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        Pedí tu diagnóstico gratis
        <span class="ml-1 inline-block transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#servicios"
        class="rounded-full border border-white/20 px-8 py-4 font-bold text-cream-50 transition-colors hover:bg-white/10"
      >
        Ver servicios
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
